<view class="page">
  <view class="watch-head"><text class="eyebrow">TRACKING DESK</text><view class="serif head-title">我的关注</view><text class="head-desc">保存查询条件，手动对比两次成功查询的结果。</text></view>
  <view class="notice notice-copper"><text class="notice-title">当前没有后台自动监测</text>只有你点击「检查更新」时才会联网对比。首次成功检查仅建立基线；失败不会显示为“无变化”。</view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">已保存 {{items.length}} 项</text><text class="section-extra" bindtap="onFind">找答案 ›</text></view>
  <state-view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" type="empty" glyph="关" title="还没有关注事项" desc="在找答案页查询后，点击「关注此查询」。" action-text="去找答案" bindaction="onFind"/>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card watch-card">
    <view class="row-between"><text class="tag tag-deep">查询条件</text><text class="small muted">{{item.checkedLabel}}</text></view>
    <view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-sub">{{item.filtersLabel}}</view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.lastError}}" class="notice notice-warn">最近检查失败：{{item.lastError}}。上次成功结果保留，不代表没有更新。</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!item.lastSuccessAt}}" class="small muted">尚未建立基线。首次检查只记录当前结果。</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{item.changes.baseline}}" class="small muted">基线包含 {{item.lastCount}} 条；之后再次检查才会计算变化。</view>
    <view wx:else class="change-line"><text>新增 {{item.addedTotal}}</text><text>修订 {{item.revisedTotal}}</text><text>未再出现 {{item.missingTotal}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.capped}}" class="small warn-line">查询只返回前 50 条，对比可能不完整；请缩小范围。</view>
    <view class="watch-actions"><view class="btn btn-primary btn-sm {{checkingId ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCheck">{{checkingId === item.id ? '检查中…' : '检查更新'}}</view><view class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onSearch">查看结果</view><text class="small muted" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDelete">删除</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="footnote">当前仅对服务端返回的已发布资料作本机对比；不是官方栏目自动监控或微信消息提醒。</view>
</view>
